        "description": "A free, India-first block theme for nonprofits and NGOs. Ships page-ready patterns for a donate page with 80G tax note and UPI/QR layout, a transparency page for 80G/12A/FCRA/CSR-1 certificates and annual reports, programs, impact stories that work without photos, volunteer signup, trustees and a registration-numbers footer. Clean, light, one changeable accent color, and looks complete with no photos or logo."
